  "notes": [
    "All tunable recommendation assumptions live here; orchestration/UI code must not embed them.",
    "Pure is a reference profile by default, not an automatically selected planned shot.",
    "Hazard scoring is boundary-proximity risk until penalty-side semantics are validated.",
    "Wind corrections are supplied by Looper's existing wind path as external carry/lateral adjustments.",
    "Strategic distance fit uses GSPro AIM distance, not PIN distance.",
    "Automatic aim remains disabled by default until solver decisions and large moves are field validated.",
    "GSPro course/hole header identity is the preferred HoleModel cache key; newest-capture selection is legacy fallback only.",
    "Tee-state inference is evidence-based: the minimap's own Tee/Fairway surface label is direct evidence; upper-right hole transition works now; future upper-left shot number and DTP can plug in without changing the calculation.",
    "State-source precedence and disagreement thresholds are centralized in source_resolution rather than embedded in probes.",
    "Post-tee W recovery is one-way only and green refinement is confidence-gated before it can replace the tee GreenSurfaceModel.",
    "Automatic round actions remain disabled by default; dry-run orchestration is the default behavior."
  ],
